 "question": "What does the build cylinder fit into?",
 "before": {
  "answer": "The sources don’t identify a part that the build cylinder “fits into.” They say the ceramic seal sits in the build base’s groove and seals against the cylinder wall [Zaxis_legend.l07; Zaxis_legend.l06], while the print platform registers on the cylinder’s top edge [Zaxis_legend.l03; Zaxis_legend.l04]. The cylinder’s two H7 fit callouts failed the ISO 286 check, so no fit relation is inferred from them [D-023.p1.vision.c06; D-023.p1.vision.c07].",
