 "after": {
  "answer": "It appears to fit into the **Main Platform / Print Platform**: the platform drawing shows a Ø262,0 H8 bore, and the cylinder drawing’s corrected callout is Ø262,0 j7. The matching sizes suggest an inferred transition fit; the drawings don’t explicitly state that they mate. [D-003.p1.vision.c15] [D-023.p1.vision.c06.C-001]\n\nThe system diagram also says the cylinder registers on the Print Platform. [Zaxis_legend.l03] [Zaxis_legend.l04] Don’t rely on the cylinder’s separate Ø264,0 H7 callout: its fit check failed because the stated lower deviation is inconsistent with H7. [D-023.p1.vision.c07]",
